                                "sense_id": "64bf22e3-7c80-315e-9c00-5849431e0a17",
                                "text": "the detonation of gun cotton"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f42a894f-cef4-3db8-9cb8-c48da900e0f6",
                        "entry_id": "3dc88b6b-f2f1-34cf-a82f-18fb51a9e7da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An explosion or sudden report made by the near-instantaneous decomposition or combustion of unstable substances. Specifically, combustion that spreads supersonically via shock compression.",
                            "Any sudden explosion made by an exothermic process (whether chemical or not) that produces a supersonic shock wave."
                        ],
